<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="blitz-brigade" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Blitz Brigade</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="mount-up-ladz" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-infantry&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-transport&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;TRANSPORT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;infantry-not-within-engagement-range&quot;,&quot;infantry-able-to-embark&quot;,&quot;infantry-wholly-within-6-of-transport&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-mount-up-ladz">Mount Up, Ladz</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>End of the Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ORKS INFANTRY unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, and one friendly TRANSPORT it is able to embark within.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>If your ORKS INFANTRY unit is wholly within 6&quot; of that TRANSPORT, it can embark within it.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="mekanised-brutality" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-battlewagon&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-move&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-mekanised-brutality">Mekanised Brutality</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One BATTLEWAGON, KILL RIG or HUNTA RIG unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, each time a unit disembarks from your unit after your unit makes a Normal move, that disembarked unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="run-em-down" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-battlewagon&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;]}},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;other-friendly-units&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;,&quot;MONSTER&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-move&quot;,&quot;up-to-two-other-units-within-6&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-run-em-down">Run 'Em Down</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One BATTLEWAGON, KILL RIG or HUNTA RIG unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Select up to two other friendly ORKS VEHICLE or ORKS MONSTER units within 6&quot; of your unit. Until the end of the turn, your unit and each unit you selected are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Advanced.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="armoured-duellists" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-shoot&quot;,&quot;attack-target-is-monster-or-vehicle&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-armoured-duellists">Armoured Duellists</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ORKS VEHICLE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes an attack that targets a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="impervious" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-battlewagon&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;selected-as-target-of-enemy-attack&quot;,&quot;attacking-strength-greater-than-toughness&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-impervious">Impervious</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One BATTLEWAGON, KILL RIG or HUNTA RIG unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="yooz-in-trouble-now" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-transport&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-battlewagon&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;]}},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;embarked-friendly-infantry&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;transport-hit-by-enemy-attack&quot;,&quot;infantry-embarked-in-transport&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-stratagem-yooz-in-trouble-now">Yooz in Trouble Now</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One BATTLEWAGON, HUNTA RIG or KILL RIG model from your army that was hit by one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>One ORKS INFANTRY unit embarked within your model makes a disembark move, then makes a surge move of up to D6&quot;.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="runnin-boots" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-bannernob&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-bigboss&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-painboss&quot;,&quot;unit-painboy&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-weirdboy&quot;,&quot;unit-wurrboy&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-runnin-boots">Runnin' Boots</button></h4><p>ORKS INFANTRY CHARACTER model only. Each time you make a Charge roll for the bearer's unit, if that unit disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn, add 1 to the result.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="blitzkaptin" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-bannernob&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss-on-squigosaur&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-bigboss&quot;,&quot;unit-deffkilla-wartrike&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-painboss&quot;,&quot;unit-painboy&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-weirdboy&quot;,&quot;unit-wurrboy&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-on-warbike&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;,&quot;unit-painboy-on-warbike&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-on-warbike&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-blitzkaptin">Blitzkaptin</button></h4><p>ORKS CHARACTER model only. After both players have deployed their armies, if the bearer's unit (or any TRANSPORT it is embarked within) is on the battlefield, select up to three ORKS VEHICLE units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="supercharged-squig-oil" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-supercharged-squig-oil">Supercharged Squig Oil</button></h4><p>MEK model only. Each time the bearer uses its Mekaniak ability, until the end of the turn, you can re-roll Charge rolls for the selected VEHICLE model's unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="tuff-git" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-bannernob&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-bigboss&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-painboss&quot;,&quot;unit-painboy&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-weirdboy&quot;,&quot;unit-wurrboy&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-tuff-git">Tuff Git</button></h4><p>ORKS INFANTRY CHARACTER model only. At the end of a phase in which the bearer's unit disembarked from a TRANSPORT, if that unit is Battle-shocked, it is no longer Battle-shocked.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="bully-boyz" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Bully Boyz</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-eadstompa" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-eadstompa">'Eadstompa</button></h4><p>Infantry Warboss model only. Each time the bearer makes an attack that targets a unit that is below its Starting Strength, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If that unit is Below Half-strength, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-big-gob" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-big-gob">Big Gob</button></h4><p>Infantry Warboss model only. At the start of the Fight phase, select one enemy unit within Engagement range of the bearer. That unit must take a Battle-shock test, and when doing so, subtract 1 from the result.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-da-biggest-boss" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss&quot;,&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-da-biggest-boss">Da Biggest Boss</button></h4><p>Infantry Warboss model only. Add 2 to the bearer's Wounds characteristic.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-tellyporta" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-warboss-in-mega-armour&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-tellyporta">Tellyporta</button></h4><p>Warboss In Mega Armour model only. Models in the bearer's unit have the Deep Strike ability.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="da-big-hunt" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Da Big Hunt</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-glory-hog" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss-on-squigosaur&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-glory-hog">Glory Hog</button></h4><p>Beastboss On Squigosaur model only. Models in the bearer's unit have the Scouts 9&quot; ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-proper-killy" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss-on-squigosaur&quot;,&quot;unit-painboss&quot;,&quot;unit-wurrboy&quot;,&quot;unit-beast-snagga-boyz&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-squighog-boyz&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-proper-killy">Proper Killy</button></h4><p>Beast Snagga model only. Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the bearer.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-skrag-every-stash" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss&quot;,&quot;unit-beastboss-on-squigosaur&quot;,&quot;unit-painboss&quot;,&quot;unit-wurrboy&quot;,&quot;unit-beast-snagga-boyz&quot;,&quot;unit-hunta-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-kill-rig&quot;,&quot;unit-squighog-boyz&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-skrag-every-stash">Skrag Every Stash!</button></h4><p>Beast Snagga model only. At the end of your Command phase, if the bearer is within range of an objective marker you control, that objective market remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start of end of any turn.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-surly-as-a-squiggoth" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-beastboss-on-squigosaur&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-surly-as-a-squiggoth">Surly As A Squiggoth</button></h4><p>Beastboss On Squigosaur model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time an attack targets that unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="dread-mob" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Dread Mob</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-gitfinder-gogglez" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-gitfinder-gogglez">Gitfinder Gogglez</button></h4><p>Mek model only. Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-press-it-fasta" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 35 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-press-it-fasta">Press It Fasta!</button></h4><p>Mek model only. Each time the bearer's unit is selected to shoot, when rolling to determine which ability that unit's weapons gain from the Try Dat Button! Detachment rule, roll one additional D6; until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit gain both Button Effects generated by those rolls. If a duplicate Button Effect is rolled, it has no additional effect.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-smoky-gubbinz" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-smoky-gubbinz">Smoky Gubbinz</button></h4><p>Mek model only. Models in the bearer's unit have the Stealth ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-supa-glowy-fing" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-big-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-in-mega-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun&quot;,&quot;unit-mek&quot;,&quot;unit-big-mek-with-kustom-force-field&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="orks-enhancement-supa-glowy-fing">Supa-glowy Fing</button></h4><p>Mek model only. In your Command phase, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; and visible to the bearer, then roll one D6: on a 1-2, that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test; on a 3-4, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 5-6, until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="freebooter-krew" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Freebooter Krew</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="bash-and-grab" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ORKS&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot